		(property "Description" "TI MSPM0G3518-Q1, RHB (VQFN-32, 5x5mm), swapped in for U1 in place of the PM (LQFP-64) footprint -- REFERENCES.md [44] addendum 2026-09-06, docs/solutions/architecture-patterns/bom-creepage-audit-can485-faraday.md finding #1. STAGED OFF-BOARD at (75, 50) for manual placement (TODO.md 12.5.bg) -- not yet positioned in the actual layout. Pin 33 (exposed thermal pad) is left WITHOUT a net: whether it must be tied to VSS/GND per TI's own guidance was NOT found in the local copy of [44] and is UNVERIFIED -- needs primary source before fab, per AGENTS.md Sec.1.3. Pins 11, 26, 30, 31 (PA7, PA22, PA26, PA27) are the audit's 4 spare GPIOs and are intentionally left with no net."
